  笔记，但不包括下文定义的「课件素材」及任何第三方组件。

- "You" / "你": any individual or entity exercising rights under this License.
  任何依本许可行使权利的个人或实体。

- "Commercial Use" / "商业用途": any use primarily intended for or directed
  toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation. This includes, without
  limitation, selling or reselling the Software; offering paid distribution,
  deployment, or hosting of the App; bundling it into a paid product or
  service; or running it to provide a service for a fee.
  包括但不限于：出售或转售本软件；对 App 提供付费分发、部署或托管；将其并入
  付费产品或服务；或以收费方式运行本软件对外提供服务。

- "Courseware Materials" / "课件素材": the lecture slides, screenshots, slide
  images (including the WebP renderings under `web/img/`), and any other
  teaching materials whose copyright belongs to their original authors (course
  instructor, university, or publisher). These are NOT licensed under this
